 "title": "Headless fail paths, quest givers killed before their quests (2): Carlitos, Ethel Phebus, ED-E, Alice McLafferty, Thomas Hildern, Astor, Edwards, Logan, Fantastic, Red Lucy, Vulpes Inculta, Raquel, Major Dhatri, Captain Parker",
