 "actions": [
  {
   "op": "note",
   "text": "Path: from a new game the player kills fourteen people before taking their quests; each OnDeath block fails or ends the quests that hang on them [observed, decompiled scripts]. Carlitos (VMS21aCarlitosSCRIPT, VMS21a below 5): VMS21a 170, whose stage script sets 180. Ethel Phebus (VMS25EthelSCRIPT): VMS25 110. ED-E in Primm (EDEScript): vDialogueEDE 100. Alice McLafferty (AliceMcLaffertyScript): VMS05 110. Thomas Hildern (ThomasHildernScript, VMS06 below 30): VMS06 200. Astor (AstorDeadScript): VMS43 40 and vCCEyeforaneye 0. Private Edwards (EdwardsDeadScript): VMS43a 20. Logan (LoganDeadScript, VMS44 below 10): VMS44 60. Fantastic (FantasticSCRIPT, objective 20 not shown): VMS03 255. Red Lucy (VMS38RedLucyScript, VMS38 below 125): VMS38 140, whose stage script sets 150. Vulpes Inculta at Nipton (VulpesIncultaNiptonSCRIPT): vNiptonVulpes 66. Raquel at Nellis (NellisRaquelSCRIPT): VNellisInfestation 0. Major Dhatri (MajorDhatriScript): VMS12 110. Captain Parker (CaptainParkerScript): VMS13 110."
  },
  {
   "op": "note",
   "text": "Stand-ins: travel by move_player to each person; each fight by kill with the player as killer (the OnDeath blocks named run as in play). Ethel Phebus is enabled by hand, standing in for the Strip's street event script (as pheeble-will does). Raquel starts disabled; the Nellis front gate steps are copied from ant-misbehavin (the gate guard's greeting enables her)."
  },
